                <AbstractText Label="RESULTS AND INTERPRETATION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">t0 he prevalence of high systolic blood pressure (SBP) in LIG and MIG school population was 3.8 and 4.4% with high WC and BMI are more likely to have hypertension.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
